.codex
CLAUDE.md
codex-schema/
# Probe runtime: a real config with real keys, plus a throwaway CODEX_HOME and
# scratch workspace that codex fills with rollouts, sessions and a database.
codex_probe/config.toml
codex_probe/home/
codex_probe/workspace/
# The editor's TS server will emit next to the sources if it ever resolves these
# files through a project without `noEmit`.
codex_probe/**/*.js
codex_probe/**/*.d.ts
codex_probe/**/*.js.map
web/node_modules

# Real-browser test failure screenshots. Written per failing case per run and
# never pruned by Vitest, so they are collected in one directory that
# `pnpm test:browser` clears before each run.
web/.vitest-screenshots

# Isolated CODEX_HOME for `pnpm start:dev`, seeded once from codex_probe/config.toml.
# Keeps dev conversations, auth and SQLite out of the developer's real ~/.codex,
# and out of codex_probe/home, which every probe run deliberately wipes.
.codex_dev
.mcp.json
.playwright-mcp
